Ladybird gives the native controls a normal line height so that a page
can collapse its own line boxes without hiding playback time. Blink
styles its current-time and time-remaining displays in
mediaControls.css. WebKit styles TimeLabel through the time-label class,
and Gecko sets a system font on the positionDurationBox containing the
two time labels.

Chrome 158.0.8127.37, Firefox 151.0, and WebKit 26.5 all showed the time
on audio controls inside a parent with zero line height, including
before metadata had loaded.
